Hit balls with Jeromy Stansberry today
Key takeaways
    1. Do not drop head in back swing, keep head still. This was causing tops
    2. scoot a bit further back from the ball, you will have to tweak this to get it right
    3. line up to target, then drop right foot back ~3". This helps draw the ball
    4. Set up grip with neutral or slightly closed club face. with dropping foot back, too closed face hooks ball
